23:["$","p",null,{"children":"The digest is seeded from the store name, so it is the same blob every time and\nthe store does not grow. But against S3 or Azure that is a PUT, a HEAD and a\nGET of a megabyte on every probe, per store, per replica. At a ten-second\nprobe period on three replicas that is eighteen megabytes a minute of pure\nprobe traffic and a billable request count to match."}]
24:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","code",null,{"children":"global.default_digest_size_health_check"}]," lowers the payload. The round trip\nitself you cannot turn off short of not enabling the health service. Whatever\nthe probe, the endpoint returns ",["$","code",null,{"children":"503"}]," if any registered indicator reports\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"failed"}]," or ",["$","code",null,{"children":"timeout"}]," (",["$","code",null,{"children":"HealthConfig.timeout_seconds"}],", default 5 s, bounds\neach check) and ",["$","code",null,{"children":"200"}]," otherwise."]}]
25:["$","div",null,{"className":"my-6 flex gap-3 rounded-xl border px-5 py-4 border-brand/40 bg-brand-soft/40 text-foreground","role":"note","children":[["$","svg",null,{"width":"20","height":"20","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"1.75","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-brand","aria-hidden":"true","children":"$0:data:0:rsc:props:children:0:props:children:2:props:children:7:props:children:0:props:children"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-1 [&>p]:my-0 [&>p+p]:mt-2","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]","children":"What to actually do"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Enable ",["$","code",null,{"children":"health: {}"}]," and probe it, but size the probe honestly: a period of 30\nseconds or more on any process whose top-level store does the round trip,\nand ",["$","code",null,{"children":"default_digest_size_health_check"}]," reduced to something like 65536\nunless you specifically want the megabyte to exercise multipart paths. And\ndo not read a ",["$","code",null,{"children":"200"}]," from a composed store as \"the store works\"; it means\n\"nothing objected,\" which for most compositions is vacuous."]}]]}]]}]
